Package: halfrule
Title: Optimal Eligibility Criteria for Randomised Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marwan", "Alqumbaey", email = "marwanalqumbaey@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-8688-9556")),
    person("Yousef M.", "Nasher", email = "yousefnasher76@gmail.com",
           role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3704-3149")))
Description: Finds which patients a randomised trial should enrol when the
    treatment effect differs between patients and wider eligibility recruits
    faster. Implements the half rule for power, the cost rule, the rule for
    expected health benefit, the correction for unadjusted analyses, and
    closed-form thresholds for time windows and subgroups.
